sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Android app
  participant SI as Google Sign-In
  participant Users
  participant UDB as Users DB

  U->>App: Tap "Sign in with Google"
  App->>SI: Request Google ID token
  SI-->>App: ID token
  App->>Users: POST /user/auth/google { idToken }
  Users->>SI: Verify ID token (signature, audience, expiry)
  alt Token valid
    SI-->>Users: Google account ID and name
    Users->>UDB: Find user by Google ID, create on first sign-in
    UDB-->>Users: User
    Users-->>App: 200 { sessionId: JWT, valid 7 days }
    App-->>U: Show dashboard
  else Token rejected
    SI-->>Users: Invalid token
    Users-->>App: 401 { message: "Login failed." }
    App-->>U: Show sign-in error
  end
